        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Before You Disappear&quot; is a visual novel (horror game) set in an abandoned school infested with ghosts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synopsis</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Due to certain circumstances, Akito, a high school student, is forced to transfer from his old school.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He accidentally wanders into an abandoned school inhabited by ghosts who harbor lingering attachments and are unable to rest in peace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I Have a Request for You&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Akito encounters a ghost girl named Nano at the abandoned school, who asks him to help one of the ghosts, named Tsukushi and Iroha, rest in peace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Akito, who desires to live a life that is useful to others, follows Nano's words and begins attending the abandoned school to help the ghosts rest in peace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Genre</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horror, Romance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click to advance through the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features multiple endings, where the outcome changes depending on the choices you make. Trying different choices will lead to branching storylines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Number of Endings: 10</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Playtime: Approximately 3 hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warning</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This work contains depictions of emotional distress, bloodshed, and murder. Those who confuse fiction with reality or find these depictions objectifying should refrain from playing.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Before You Disappear&quot; is a visual novel (horror game) set in an abandoned school infested with ghosts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Synopsis</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Due to certain circumstances, Akito, a high school student, is forced to transfer from his old school.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He accidentally wanders into an abandoned school inhabited by ghosts who harbor lingering attachments and are unable to rest in peace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I Have a Request for You&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Akito encounters a ghost girl named Nano at the abandoned school, who asks him to help one of the ghosts, named Tsukushi and Iroha, rest in peace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Akito, who desires to live a life that is useful to others, follows Nano's words and begins attending the abandoned school to help the ghosts rest in peace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Genre</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horror, Romance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >System</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click to advance through the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features multiple endings, where the outcome changes depending on the choices you make. Trying different choices will lead to branching storylines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Number of Endings: 10</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Playtime: Approximately 3 hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warning</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This work contains depictions of emotional distress, bloodshed, and murder. Those who confuse fiction with reality or find these depictions objectifying should refrain from playing.</p>",
